Subject: [PWG-Announce] PWG August 2020 Face-to-Face Meeting - Summary

Greetings,

The PWG held its August 2020 Virtual Face-to-Face Meeting on August 18-20,
2020 via Zoom teleconferences. Representatives from Canon, Canonical,
Google, High North, HP Inc., Konica Minolta, Kyocera, Lakeside Robotics,
Lexmark, Qualcomm, Ricoh, TIC, TCS and Xerox attended the meetings, among
others. Attendees reviewed work in progress, including drafts of a number
of in-progress specifications, and discussed liaisons with partner groups.
Click here for a summary of the proceedings:

https://www.pwg.org/blog/pwg-august-2020-F2F-summary.html

Thanks to all who attended! Stay healthy!

Smith

/**
    Smith Kennedy
    Chair, IEEE ISTO Printer Working Group
*/


